	(text "J2 TO_BOARD: 1 = VDDA (board 3.3 V)   2 = PA0 / ADC1_INP16 (config rx_input 1) or PA6 / ADC1_INP3 (rx_input 0)   3 = GND\nFirmware: 16-bit, 12 kHz, expects the signal centred at mid-scale and removes DC itself."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1144a43d-5047-462f-b852-5e73c559d593")
	)
	(text "ngspice (variant A): passband -9.66 dB; -3 dB at 5.7 Hz and 4.38 kHz; -36.9 dB at 300 kHz.\nClamps hold the ADC pin within -0.33..+3.63 V up to 20 Vpp in (1.0 mA). Bias settles in 290 ms.\nC1: film (MKS2/MKT). C2: C0G. R4/R5/C3 form VB = VDDA/2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 153.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7dedb4ef-d1a6-47e5-b932-abbf381f5071")
	)
	(text "JP1: CLOSE ONLY if the Baofeng speaker output is single-ended (SPK- at 0 V DC).\nIf both speaker terminals sit at ~Vbat/2 (bridge-tied amplifier), leave JP1 OPEN\nand feed SPK+/SPK- through a 600:600 audio transformer instead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e6a597ca-ffe5-4cfd-a64f-2c5b5a276c93")
	)
